      Content description of the playback notification control that moves the
      reading backwards. %1$d is how many seconds it moves by.
    -->
    <item quantity="one">Rinculà di %1$d seconda</item>
    <item quantity="other">Rinculà di %1$d seconde</item>
  </plurals>
